<h2 id="sec-1">Top Picks Summary</h2>
<p>Air fryers have revolutionized home cooking, and compact models make them accessible even for the smallest kitchens. We tested 15 compact air fryers (under 0.5 cu ft) for cooking performance, ease of use, cleaning, and footprint.</p>
